      content: '<div class="not-content my-6">\n  <AccordionPreview client:load />\n</div>\n\n## Installation\n\n<PackageInstall />\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\n<Accordion type="single" collapsible>\n  <AccordionItem value="item-1">\n    <AccordionTrigger>What is RefineUI?</AccordionTrigger>\n    <AccordionContent>\n      RefineUI is a design system and component library.\n    </AccordionContent>\n  </AccordionItem>\n  <AccordionItem value="item-2">\n    <AccordionTrigger>How do I install it?</AccordionTrigger>\n    <AccordionContent>\n      Run: bun add @refineui/react @refineui/tokens\n    </AccordionContent>\n  </AccordionItem>\n</Accordion>\n\n<Accordion type="multiple" defaultValue={["item-1", "item-2"]}>\n  {/* Multiple panels can be open */}\n</Accordion>\n\n<Accordion size="lg" value={openItem} onValueChange={setOpenItem}>\n  {/* Controlled accordion */}\n</Accordion>\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Accordion\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <PropSpec\n    client:load\n    rows={[\n    { prop: "type", default: "\\"single\\"", type: "\\"single\\" | \\"multiple\\"", description: "Selection mode: single or multiple panels open." },\n    { prop: "collapsible", default: "false", type: "boolean", description: "Allows closing the last open panel (single mode)." },\n    { prop: "value", default: "\u2014", type: "string | string[]", description: "Controlled open panel value(s)." },\n    { prop: "defaultValue", default: "\u2014", type: "string | string[]", description: "Uncontrolled initial open panel(s)." },\n    { prop: "onValueChange", default: "\u2014", type: "(value?: string | string[]) => void", description: "Event handler when open panels change." },\n    { prop: "size", default: "\\"md\\"", type: "\\"sm\\" | \\"md\\" | \\"lg\\"", description: "Size tier (affects typography)." }\n    ]}\n  />\n</div>\n### AccordionItem\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <PropSpec\n    client:load\n    rows={[\n    { prop: "value", default: "\u2014", type: "string", description: "Unique identifier for this item (required)." }\n    ]}\n  />\n</div>\n### AccordionTrigger\n\nClickable header that toggles the panel.\n\n### AccordionContent\n\nCollapsible content panel.',
      searchText: 'accordion collapsible content panels for dense info. \n<div class="not-content my-6">\n  <accordionpreview client:load />\n</div>\n\n## installation\n\n<packageinstall />\n\n## usage\n\n```tsx\n<accordion type="single" collapsible>\n  <accordionitem value="item-1">\n    <accordiontrigger>what is refineui?</accordiontrigger>\n    <accordioncontent>\n      refineui is a design system and component library.\n    </accordioncontent>\n  </accordionitem>\n  <accordionitem value="item-2">\n    <accordiontrigger>how do i install it?</accordiontrigger>\n    <accordioncontent>\n      run: bun add @refineui/react @refineui/tokens\n    </accordioncontent>\n  </accordionitem>\n</accordion>\n\n<accordion type="multiple" defaultvalue={["item-1", "item-2"]}>\n  {/* multiple panels can be open */}\n</accordion>\n\n<accordion size="lg" value={openitem} onvaluechange={setopenitem}>\n  {/* controlled accordion */}\n</accordion>\n```\n\n## api reference\n\n### accordion\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <propspec\n    client:load\n    rows={[\n    { prop: "type", default: "\\"single\\"", type: "\\"single\\" | \\"multiple\\"", description: "selection mode: single or multiple panels open." },\n    { prop: "collapsible", default: "false", type: "boolean", description: "allows closing the last open panel (single mode)." },\n    { prop: "value", default: "\u2014", type: "string | string[]", description: "controlled open panel value(s)." },\n    { prop: "defaultvalue", default: "\u2014", type: "string | string[]", description: "uncontrolled initial open panel(s)." },\n    { prop: "onvaluechange", default: "\u2014", type: "(value?: string | string[]) => void", description: "event handler when open panels change." },\n    { prop: "size", default: "\\"md\\"", type: "\\"sm\\" | \\"md\\" | \\"lg\\"", description: "size tier (affects typography)." }\n    ]}\n  />\n</div>\n### accordionitem\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <propspec\n    client:load\n    rows={[\n    { prop: "value", default: "\u2014", type: "string", description: "unique identifier for this item (required)." }\n    ]}\n  />\n</div>\n### accordiontrigger\n\nclickable header that toggles the panel.\n\n### accordioncontent\n\ncollapsible content panel.\n\n'
