      category: "development",
      content: '<PackageInstallFull />\n\n## CSS\n\nLoad token CSS and component interaction styles once at the app root:\n\n```css\n@import "@refineui/tokens/tailwind.css";\n@import "@refineui/web-icons/dist/fonts/refineui-system-icons.css";\n@import "@refineui/react/refineui.css";\n```\n\n## First component\n\n```tsx\nexport function App() {\n  return <Button variant="primary">Continue</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nUse the same imports in documentation previews \u2014 no parallel mock UI.',
      searchText: 'installation add refineui packages and load foundation css. \n<packageinstallfull />\n\n## css\n\nload token css and component interaction styles once at the app root:\n\n```css\n@import "@refineui/tokens/tailwind.css";\n@import "@refineui/web-icons/dist/fonts/refineui-system-icons.css";\n@import "@refineui/react/refineui.css";\n```\n\n## first component\n\n```tsx\nexport function app() {\n  return <button variant="primary">continue</button>;\n}\n```\n\nuse the same imports in documentation previews \u2014 no parallel mock ui.\n'
